      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.9166666666666665,
      "text": "A 3-bet is not just a bigger call. It changes the hand."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.9166666666666665,
      "end": 8,
      "text": "Strong hands 3-bet for value because worse hands can continue."
    },
    {
      "start": 8,
      "end": 16,
      "text": "Some suited blocker hands 3-bet as pressure, because they reduce the chance villain has the strongest hands and still play well when called."
    },
    {
      "start": 16,
      "end": 19.791666666666668,
      "text": "Ace-five suited is a classic example against a late open."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.791666666666668,
      "end": 25.625,
      "text": "It blocks ace-king and ace-queen, can make the nut flush, and does not want to just call every time."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.625,
      "end": 29.791666666666668,
      "text": "The leak is only 3-betting premiums and becoming easy to read."
    }
  ],
